[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681777008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103277#issuecomment-2681777008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103277","id":2681777008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f2Ktw","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T12:19:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T12:19:46Z","body":"I can't reproduce it on Linux. I see that your MRP includes a texture with dimension 17000x750.\n\nIn my case it's not crashing but the imported textured is empty, while it should look like this:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c539c543-66b3-4e6c-b00a-6b3500aaa9c2)\n\nIt's not surprising, as I believe several GPUs have a size limit of 16384x16384, which Godot used to have a max supported size. It seems now that we have `MAX_WIDTH = 16777216` in `Image`, but I'm not sure we properly support this.\n\nIf I set a size limit in the import settings (to the max which seems to be 4096), then it displays fine, but obviously cropped at 4096. If I manually crop the image to 16384x750, it also imports fine.\n\nCC @BlueCube3310 for the import size constraints, and @bruvzg for the potential crash on macOS which we should aim to prevent either way, even if we don't want to support widths above 16384.\n\n@cwjj67 In general, this texture is not in a good format for game development. I would suggest you edit it to remove the unnecessary transparent space between each frames. A sprite sheet typically only has the minimal amount of transparent space around the character so that each frame can fit within the same dimensions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681777008/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681780473","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103277#issuecomment-2681780473","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103277","id":2681780473,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f2Lj5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T12:21:13Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T12:21:13Z","body":"Yes, max texture size supported by Metal is [16384 x 16384](https://developer.apple.com/metal/Metal-Feature-Set-Tables.pdf), this also applies to [MoltenVK](https://vulkan.gpuinfo.org/displayreport.php?id=34529#properties).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681780473/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681789397","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103277#issuecomment-2681789397","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103277","id":2681789397,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6f2NvV","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-25T12:25:08Z","updated_at":"2025-02-25T12:28:47Z","body":"I can't reproduce the crash with current master, it's just printing errors as expected:\n\n```\n  ERROR: Texture dimensions exceed device maximum.\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp:836 - Condition \"texture.rd_texture.is_null()\" is true.\n  ERROR: Attempting to use an uninitialized RID\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp:1581 - Parameter \"tex\" is null.\n  ERROR: Attempting to use an uninitialized RID\n```\n\nWorks fine if image is cropped to the size below limit.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2681789397/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]